      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6004517efa4e6112",
      "translationZh": "在 AI Gateway 前配置 Access 后，Claude Code、Codex 和 OpenCode 等工具可以自动继承此身份上下文。Cloudflare Access 可供最多 50 名用户的团队免费使用，使其成为入门的简便方式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "df5342bfcd52da83",
      "translationZh": "开始使用 AI Gateway User Insights",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d38101c16a1f443c",
      "translationZh": "AI 使用正在快速变化。模型会变化，团队会开发新的工作流程，而对某一组合适的选择可能对另一组不合适。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b02b711cfbb9933",
      "translationZh": "User Insights 使团队能够通过识别某些模型可能过度使用的位置来开始做出更明智的选择。然后他们可以看到哪些用户和代理正在推动该使用情况，了解其背后的任务，并比较完成工作的成本。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cebc9ec4abdf93d1",
      "translationZh": "通过阅读 AI Gateway User Insights 文档了解更多信息。在 Cloudflare 仪表板中打开 AI Gateway，并利用所学知识做出更有针对性的模型和路由决策。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
